        © 2024 kube-triage. Open source under MIT License.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        <span>v1.0.0</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/Jani-shiv/kube-triage/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] transition-colors">Changelog</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Jani-shiv/kube-triage/blob/main/SECURITY.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text-primary)] transition-colors">Security</a>
      </div>
    </div>
